{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into\u00a0<strong>Spellbound Emporium</strong> and become the new owner of a cozy gift shop in an enchanted world. <strong>Build</strong>, <strong>stock</strong> and <strong>grow</strong> your fantasy shop to become the biggest and <strong>most magical</strong> store in all the land! Greet a variety of fantastical characters, each on the hunt for <strong>unique</strong> and <strong>magic-infused items</strong> and with pockets laden with gold!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/gif-a-border.gif?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/tag-d.png?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Furnish your shop</strong> with bookcases, decorations, shelves and <strong>stock your store</strong> with enchanted items, books, gifts and more! Every day brings a new type of customer looking for different books and items to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/gif-b.gif?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/tag-e.png?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow herbs</strong> and<strong> brew potions</strong>\u00a0to stock your shelves with a variety of potions to attract different types of customers. Whether a customers is an elf looking for a love potion or a dwarf after a deadly poison (keep is shush-shush!), get brewing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/gif-c.gif?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/tag-f.png?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customise</strong> your store completely - from the color of the walls and cases to the wall decorations, plants and much more. Fancy a wholesome cosy vibe to your store or a dark gothic store to cater to the infernal demons that like a spell book and a coffee?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/gif-d.gif?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/tag-g.png?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock</strong>\u00a0<strong>new items</strong> and <strong>more space</strong> for your store by reinvesting in <strong>expanding the store space</strong>, purchasing more furniture and sourcing new and enchanted stock and become the biggest and best magical store in all the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/gif-e.gif?t=1745858585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673300?t=1745858585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/5c109477381340a790ea298fa33f60c83229928a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745858585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/7586f6a11cc0145788043d63892e4edc94a01ad3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745858585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/7586f6a11cc0145788043d63892e4edc94a01ad3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17458